  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This is a regression of FCREPO-3358.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Basically stand Fedora up inside Tomcat and try to browse to ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "(assuming you named the war fcrepo.war)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "You'll get a 500 Server Error due to changes related to FCREPO-3598.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In Tomcat when you browse to /fcrepo/ the request.getServletPath() returns \"/index.html\". Which causes the logic to fail.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
