  "description": "<p>This is a regression of \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-3358\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3358\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/ produces a 500 and  stack trace\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-3358\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n.</p>\n\n<p>Basically stand Fedora up inside Tomcat and try to browse to <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/</a><br/>\n(assuming you named the war fcrepo.war)</p>\n\n<p>You'll get a 500 Server Error due to changes related to \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-3598\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3598\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"URIs in RDF beginning with / are producing invalid URIs\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-3598\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n.</p>\n\n<p>In Tomcat when you browse to /fcrepo/ the request.getServletPath() returns \"/index.html\". Which causes the logic to fail.</p>",
